    "summary": "ImageMagick: Memory Leak in wand option parser when providing invalid arguments",
    "details": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to version 7.1.2-25, when providing invalid options to the wand option parser a small memory leak will occur. This issue has been patched in version 7.1.2-25.",
